        "original_id": "a3a3598f-45bf-5b19-8320-bf55c7eecc51",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Dandong, Hotan, Liaoning province, Xinjiang, China\n- Companies: SG Automotive Group Co Ltd, Liaoning Shuguang Automotive Group, Ltd\n\nFacts:\n- Dandong, formerly known as Andong, is a prefecture-level city in southeastern Liaoning province in the People's Republic of China.\n- Hotan, also transliterated from Chinese as Hetian, is a major oasis town in southwestern Xinjiang, an autonomous region in western China.\n- SG Automotive Group Co Ltd, officially Liaoning Shuguang Automotive Group, Ltd, is a Chinese vehicle and component manufacturer headquartered in Dandong, Liaoning province.",
